    description: "Found by the 2026-10-31 docstring staleness audit (dev 5f6b2af921): a reviewer flagged it and a default-REJECT verifier re-reproduced it on a fixture of its own (reports under ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/staleness_audit_10312026/review and verify). Corpus impact not measured. puppet.py:374/388 dst=f\"puppet:resource:{value}\". service { 'nginx': require => Package['nginx'] } gives dst puppet:resource:Package['nginx'], which finalize pads with an <unknown> path; the package[nginx] resource two lines above is never reached. Same class as WI-zihij, which does not list puppet. v10."  # d8af
